d:["$","aside",null,{"className":"seasonal-food-note","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-kicker","children":"Eat the season"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Look for persimmons, mikan, roasted sweet potatoes (",["$","i",null,{"children":"yaki-imo"}],"), chestnuts, new-harvest rice, and the start of crab and oyster season. Grab late Shine Muscat grapes if you see them; toward month’s end, watch for winter’s first premium strawberries. More on food below!"]}]]}]
e:["$","section",null,{"className":"guide-section","id":"recommendation","aria-labelledby":"recommendation-title","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"guide-section__header","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-kicker","children":"If you ask us"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"recommendation-title","children":"Our recommendation"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Every trip will look a little different, but the shape is simple: anchor on Tokyo and the wedding, then give whatever time remains to Kyoto and Osaka."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"itinerary-plans","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"itinerary-plan itinerary-plan--half","data-itinerary-plan":"one-week","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"With one week"}],"Land in Tokyo, take it in slowly, and let the wedding weekend cap the trip. You can also do this in reverse if you’re arriving right before the wedding!"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar","role":"img","aria-label":"One-week plan: three to four full days in Tokyo, then three days at the wedding in Yamanashi.","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar__segment itinerary-bar__segment--tokyo","style":{"flexGrow":4},"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Tokyo"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"3–4 full days"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar__segment itinerary-bar__segment--wedding","style":{"flexGrow":3},"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"The wedding"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"3 days · Yamanashi"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"itinerary-plan","data-itinerary-plan":"two-weeks","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"With two weeks"}],"Keep the same start, then head west and spend the remainder in Kyoto and Osaka, fitting in ",["$","a",null,{"href":"#more-japan","children":"day trips"}]," as they call to you. This order works the best geographically but again, you can reorder depending on your arrival date."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar","role":"img","aria-label":"Two-week plan: three to four full days in Tokyo, three days at the wedding in Yamanashi, then the remainder in Kyoto and Osaka with day trips as you like.","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar__segment itinerary-bar__segment--tokyo","style":{"flexGrow":4},"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Tokyo"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"3–4 full days"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar__segment itinerary-bar__segment--wedding","style":{"flexGrow":3},"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"The wedding"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"3 days · Yamanashi"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"itinerary-bar__segment itinerary-bar__segment--kansai","style":{"flexGrow":7},"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Kyoto & Osaka"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The remainder · day trips as you like"}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"osaka-math","aria-labelledby":"osaka-math-title","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-kicker","children":"The Osaka math"}],["$","h3",null,{"id":"osaka-math-title","children":"Osaka is a day trip, not a base"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Osaka is an easy day trip from Kyoto, and that is how we would plan it. If the neon and the food pull you in for longer, sleep there one or two nights at most and give Kyoto the rest."}]]}]]}]
f:["$","section",null,{"className":"guide-section","id":"plan","aria-labelledby":"plan-title","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"guide-section__header","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-kicker","children":"Before you go"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"plan-title","children":"A little planning pays off"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Japan rewards advance planning more than almost anywhere we have traveled—mostly because the good stuff books up."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"planning-disclosures","children":[[["$","details","Two to three months out",{"open":true,"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],"Two to three months out"]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"tagged-list","children":[["$","li","Passport, flights, hotels",{"className":"tagged-list__item--illustrated","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"tagged-list__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"guide-icon","data-guide-icon":"passport","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","aria-hidden":"true","focusable":"false","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.7","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":"5","y":"3.5","width":"13.5","height":"17","rx":"1.4"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M8.5 3.5v17"}],["$","circle",null,{"cx":"13.5","cy":"11.2","r":"2.8"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M10.8 11.2h5.4M13.5 8.4c1.3 1.5 1.3 4.1 0 5.6M13.5 8.4c-1.3 1.5-1.3 4.1 0 5.6"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"tagged-list__body","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"tagged-list__heading","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Passport, flights, hotels"}],null]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Check that your passport and visas are valid through the trip; book flights and hotels, including at least one night at a ryokan."}],null]}]]}],["$","li","Check your medications",{"className":"tagged-list__item--illustrated","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"tagged-list__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":[